"For each language, enter the current (existing) translation you want to "
"find; every case-insensitive occurrence in the stored translations will be "
"replaced with the new translation, keeping the original capitalization."
msgstr ""
"برای هر زبان، ترجمه فعلی (موجود) را که می‌خواهید پیدا کنید وارد نمایید؛ هر "
